HST Office: HST Sheets ribbon commands (Home, View, Insert).

- .uno:HstUnfreezePanes ("Bỏ cố định ngăn") removes frozen panes only and is disabled while nothing is frozen
  (.uno:FreezePanes toggles, so it would freeze at the cursor when nothing is frozen). It is the last entry of the
  freezepanes popup, which the ribbon's "Cố định ngăn ▾" split button opens.
- "Tự tính tổng ▾" and "Gộp và căn giữa ▾" are split buttons in Sheets: a Calc-only GenericPopupToolbarController
  for .uno:AutoSum and .uno:ToggleMergeCells opens the popups hstautosum (Sum, Average, Count, Max, Min, Function)
  and hstmergecells (Merge and Center, Merge Cells, Unmerge Cells). The AutoSum variants are the upstream
  .uno:AutoSum?Function:string=… arguments; their labels are new CalcCommands.xcu nodes.
- .uno:InsertObjectChart takes an optional ChartType (Column, Line or Pie): the new chart gets that chart type
  template before the chart wizard opens, so the ribbon's Column/Line/Pie buttons start the wizard on that type.
  A ChartType alone keeps the interactive path (range from the selection, chart on the current sheet).
- Vietnamese labels of the new commands in UI.po.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: build only (every C++ file syntax-checked against the configured tree). Runtime: View ▸ Cố định ngăn ▾ ▸
Bỏ cố định ngăn (disabled until panes are frozen); Home ▸ Tự tính tổng ▾ / Gộp và căn giữa ▾ arrows; Insert ▸ Biểu đồ cột/đường/tròn open the wizard on that type.
